# No secrets belong in VITE_* variables (they are public).
# Live transport configuration pending Q07 origin/security agreement.

# Address search (Google Places API (New)). Copy to .env.local for `npm run dev`; for Docker put the
# same names in the root .env used by compose. Everything here is shipped to the browser, so none of
# it may be a secret: restrict the key in Google Cloud to HTTP referrers of this app and to the
# "Places API (New)" only, and set a quota/budget alert.
# Without a key the address fields are plain text inputs.
VITE_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Quiet time after the last keystroke before a search is sent (default 500).
# VITE_ADDRESS_SEARCH_DEBOUNCE_MS=500

# Proposals near this circle rank first; other places are still offered (default: Dimitrovgrad, 15 km, max 50000).
# VITE_ADDRESS_BIAS_LAT=42.05
# VITE_ADDRESS_BIAS_LNG=25.6
# VITE_ADDRESS_BIAS_RADIUS_M=15000
